  "details": "I think it would be neat if you could get the logs for udon and other stuff in the game like we have it for avatar debug or OSC. Where the window is a grabbable object that follows you around. \nRight now it's possible to get the view up in game. But we get the curved window that might spawn across the map. And can only be moved with the quick menu.\nHaving easy access to this would help when you debug stuff that only apply to vr players. So you don't have to have screen overlays open and looking at the unity logs.\nWould also be nice if scrolling in the avatar and OSC debug was not on keyboard only. But either through joystick, a button to scroll up and down on the panel or similar.",
